    {
      "id": "N19",
      "cue": "direction",
      "focus": "stationary_flux",
      "text": "停住后，磁通不再变，电流归零。"
    },
    {
      "id": "N20",
      "cue": "direction",
      "focus": "lenz_decreasing",
      "text": "反向拉，入纸磁通减少，感应磁场与电流都反向。"
    },
    {
      "id": "N21",
      "cue": "energy",
      "focus": "mechanical_energy_source",
      "text": "维持匀速推动，需要外力克服向左的安培力。"
    },
    {
      "id": "N22",
      "cue": "energy",
      "focus": "force_relation",
      "text": "电流越大，棒受到的安培力也越大。"
