      "id": "N23",
      "cue": "energy",
      "focus": "power_from_work",
      "text": "外力乘运动速度，给出输入功率。"
    },
    {
      "id": "N24",
      "cue": "energy",
      "focus": "power_product",
      "text": "把安培力代入。"
    },
    {
      "id": "N25",
      "cue": "energy",
      "focus": "mechanical_to_heat",
      "text": "这份机械功率，恰好变成电阻的发热功率。"
